      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "After using Grok Bot for about a week, I have to say guys, I get it.\n\nIt's not doing things that I can't already do on Codex / Claude, but it's just so much easier to do it. I can see the appeal.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
