      "text": "My 2022 Model 3 has become my second office, and Grok @bot is my co-pilot.\n\nOn my drive to work, I just talk:\n\"Any Tesla news from Korea today?\"\n\"Make the chart for tonight's post.\"\n\"What's on my calendar?\"\n\nBy the time I park, the news is summarized, the graphic is ready in my style, and my day is organized.\nI don't do tasks anymore. I just talk while I drive.",
